{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/av4DYtO5DnnTeLmJfTzKpQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:06.255735+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/av4DYtO5DnnTeLmJfTzKpQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><strong><span>2026年大学生</span></strong></span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>夏令营活动通知</span></strong></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span>中国疾病预防控制中心环境与健康相关产品安全所（以下简称环境所）成立于2002年，环境所是中国疾病预防控制中心（中国预防医学科学院）的直属事业单位，是国家级环境与健康专业机构和全国环境与健康业务技术指导中心。在国家疾控局和中国疾病预防控制中心（中国预防医学科学院）的领导下，围绕疾病防控、卫生应急、科学研究、教育培训、国际合作五位一体的核心定位，开展环境危害因素的人群暴露、健康效应和健康影响以及消毒与感染防护的调查、监测和科学研究，预防和控制环境污染相关疾病，为国家制定环境健康和消毒与感染控制相关的法律、法规、政策、标准、规范、规划等提供科学依据和技术支持。环境所是流行病与卫生统计学、劳动卫生与环境卫生学、卫生毒理学博士硕士学位授权点、公共卫生博士硕士专业学位授权点和博士后流动站。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动目的</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span>为增进优秀大学生对公共卫生和环境健康领域前沿知识的认识，为全国重点院校优秀应届毕业生提供了解环境所学术科研、学习生活环境的机会，搭建导师和学生之间交流的平台，环境所拟举办2026年全国优秀大学生“相约疾控•共筑健康”暑期夏令营活动，热忱欢迎公共卫生与预防医学、卫生检验等相关专业同学报名。</span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>报名时间：即日起至2026年6月30日</span></p><p><span>活动时间：2026年7月上旬（具体举办时间另行通知）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>招收人数和活动方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营拟面向全国高校择优招收约20名营员，活动内容包括但不限于：实验室参观、专家讲座、师生交流、招生咨询等</span></p><p><span>（具体活动安排及日程以入选后正式通知为准）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>招收对象与报名条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）品德良好、遵纪守法、身心健康、学风端正。2027年毕业的普通高校全日制在校本科生，预计有推免资格者优先；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）具有公共卫生、预防医学等医学相关专业背景或相关交叉学科背景，对公共卫生和疾病预防控制有浓厚兴趣，有志相关学术或应用研究工作，具有较强或潜在的科研和创新能力；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）学习成绩优秀，“双一流”高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前50%、“所在学科教育部第四轮学科评估B+及以上”高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前20%、普通类高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前5%优先；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（四）英语水平良好，最低需要达到全国大学英语四级（460分以上）、六级（430分以上）或TOEFL、GRE等考试成绩优秀者。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）《中国疾控中心环境所2026年大学生暑期夏令营报名申请表》（点击附件1下载，加盖院系教务公章或部门公章）扫描件；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）本人有效期内的身份证与学生证原件扫描件；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）加盖院系教务部门公章的本科成绩单扫描件；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（四）外语水平证明原件扫描件，如CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（五）其他可证明培养潜力和能力的材料扫描件：如在学术期刊上发表的文章、出版物或其他学术作品、专利、各类获奖证书等；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（六）《环境所夏令营活动诚信承诺书》（本人签字后扫描件）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名及入选事宜</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）以上所有材料的扫描件，按照1-6顺序整合成一个PDF文件，以“学校名-专业名-本人姓名”命名，于2026年6月30日16:00前发送至邮箱：</span></p><p><span>lvpengbo@nieh.chinacdc.cn，逾期不再接收。邮件主题为: XX大学-专业-姓名；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）邮件发出后请点击：</span></p><p><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/PNwT6YV.aspx# 进行报名登记</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）环境所将以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等作为主要评价依据，从申请者中筛选出约20人，并于活动举办前通过电话和邮件告知入选者。未接到通知的同学即未入选，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>营员待遇</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）本次夏令营将根据营员表现评选出优秀营员，颁发优秀营员证书。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）夏令营期间提供免费食宿，交通费用自理。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）环境所为营员统一购买活动期间的团体意外保险。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）活动最新消息可在环境所官网的通知公告栏目查询</span></p><p><span>（网址：https://iehs.chinacdc.cn/</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）入选营员报到时需提供本人学生证及身份证原件，入营后需服从环境所管理全程参加夏令营活动。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联 系 人：赵老师  吕老师</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span></p><p><span>010-50930149，010-50930217；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：</span></p><p><span>lvpengbo@nieh.chinacdc.cn</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span>附件1：环境所2026年大学生暑期夏令营报名申请表</span></p><span><img alt=\"2620c5193d8bb4c15cd8c25c91f0bebf.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Kicgaua4MXaeWjdW3ICcTkKElc23JLRjcLiaZyfZBoppYYnvUhWLB8CZKUQ5DVl8tYvTIjSw9Ks8m4RHMEiaQRVY15OicbZlyGEMlyTbSeSHFJA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span><p><span>附件2： 2026年环境所夏令营营员承诺书</span></p><span><img alt=\"e602c84b9113a452498818cd66e4c59a.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Kicgaua4MXafY7BH2c3s8ib8iasymicLwGw6ckQvic2OpALxvtqfSTHWbEv8dwa70D8nSum9Omosdw8TN3E0FZJFejJCGbTCbgianEvzzY62ETJe4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span><p><span>也可以点击最下方阅读原文，在网页中下载附件</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>ENDEND</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Ljib4So7yuWgqSJOVMNYcx5SUVAXH5BJqibMSHCnNUsURx4ahQbnicaD9rgSg5uGxUf5ibeaBE1vP5WqvE9veicMicFw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section><section><section><p><span><span>01.<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMzI5OTg3NQ==&amp;mid=2649471941&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=899c105eaee411f29abf972763d427f5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国气象局气象与医疗健康重点开放实验室2026年度开放课题申报指南的通知</a></span></span></p><p><span><span>02.<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwMzI5OTg3NQ==&amp;mid=2649471931&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=90d086b427e573d16eb837161ef8b7fc&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">6・5 世界